    {
      "node_type": "function",
      "name": "_extract_themes_agentic",
      "line_number": 437,
      "docstring": "Extract thematic keywords using agentic reasoning.\n\nIn production, this would make 20 RAG calls with:\n- COT depth=6 (deepest reasoning chain)\n- TOT branches=4 (explore 4 reasoning paths)\n- TOT depth=4 (recursive exploration)\n- Self-consistency=12 (ensemble voting from 12 candidates)\n- Reflexion=True (self-correction loops)",
      "imports": [],
      "dependencies": [],
      "responsibility_level": "L5",
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "node_type": "function",
      "name": "_extract_linkedin_authenticity",
      "line_number": 482,
      "docstring": "Extract authenticity patterns from LinkedIn profiles.\n\nIn production, this would:\n1. Search for \u226510 senior executive profiles in similar roles\n2. Extract language patterns from their profiles\n3. Categorize patterns by type (summary, verbs, metrics, competencies)\n4. Return authentic phrasing guidance\n\nArgs:\n    job_description: JD text\n    thematic_results: Themes from phase 1\n    num_calls: Number of RAG calls (15)\n    min_profiles: Minimum profiles to analyze (10)\n\nReturns:\n    AuthenticityPatterns with learned patterns",
      "imports": [],
      "dependencies": [
        "AuthenticityPatterns"
      ],
      "responsibility_level": "L5",
      "children": []
    },
    {
